# Local build artifacts / probes
._probe_tmp.md

# Planning, design and implementation notes live at the repo root and are kept
# out of the published repo for now. Markdown inside subdirectories (the
# workspace seed, plugin docs) is still tracked.
#
# NOTE: README.md is already tracked upstream, so this rule does not untrack
# it -- gitignore only applies to untracked files. It stays as published until
# it is reworked.
/*.md

# Visual Studio solution
*.slnx

# Local Copilot instructions: kept on disk, never published. Contains host
# details (addresses, SSH user) specific to this deployment.
.github/copilot-instructions.md
